The Votrax SC-01-A model in src/chips/votrax-sc01.{h,cpp} and src/chips/votrax-sc01-rom.h was
written from the Votrax datasheet and patent US 4,433,210 (see docs/sources.md). MAME's
src/devices/sound/votrax.cpp was read as a reference for what only the die shows: the ROM bit
order, the capacitor sizes, the glottal levels, the clock dividers and the noise register. No
code was copied from it. The ROM image (sc01a.bin) is from the 2007 decap of the chip. That file
